---
// Die anderen Gestaltungen dieses Portfolios – getrennt von den Kundenprojekten
// (wie in v5). Ohne die aktuelle Seite (isCurrent aus projectData.js).
import { projects } from "../data/projectData.js";

// Kurzlabels wie im Versionstoggle
const LABELS = { v1: "Classic", v2: "Story", v3: "Motion", terminal: "Codespace", v5: "Modernist", b2b: "Seriös" };

const versions = projects
  .filter((p) => p.category === "Portfolio" && !p.isCurrent)
  .map((p) => ({ ...p, label: LABELS[p.key] ?? "" }));
---

{versions.length > 0 && (
  <section id="versions" class="versions-section" aria-labelledby="versions-title">
    <div class="terminal-window offscreen">
      <div class="terminal-titlebar">
        <div class="terminal-dots" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="dot-red"></span>
          <span class="dot-yellow"></span>
          <span class="dot-green"></span>
        </div>
        <span class="terminal-title">versions — colin@webdev</span>
      </div>

      <div class="terminal-body">
        <p class="terminal-cmd">
          <span class="usr">colin@webdev</span><span class="punct">:</span><span
            class="pth">~/portfolio</span
          ><span class="punct">$</span> ls versions/
        </p>

        <h2 id="versions-title">Weitere Versionen dieses Portfolios</h2>
        <p class="intro">
          Dieses Portfolio gibt es in mehreren Gestaltungen – dieselben Inhalte,
          jeweils ein anderer Ansatz.
        </p>

        <ul class="v-list">
          {versions.map((v) => (
            <li>
              <a class="v-item" href={v.website}>
                <img class="v-img" src={v.image} alt="" width="1600" height="1000" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
                <span class="v-name">{v.title}</span>
                {v.label && <span class="v-label">{v.label}</span>}
                <span class="v-copy">{v.description}</span>
              </a>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
)}

<style>
  .versions-section {
    padding: 2rem 0 2rem;
  }

  h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--step-2, 1.6rem);
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin: 0.5rem 0 0.5rem;
  }

  .intro {
    font-family: "Inter", sans-serif;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
    max-width: 60ch;
  }

  .v-list {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(190px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem 1.25rem;
  }

  .v-item {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    height: 100%;
    padding-top: 0.75rem;
    border-top: 2px solid var(--term-window-border, var(--border));
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: border-color 0.25s ease;
  }
  .v-item:hover,
  .v-item:focus-visible {
    border-top-color: var(--accent);
  }

  .v-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 10;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: top center;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    filter: grayscale(1) contrast(1.08);
    transition: filter 0.25s ease;
  }
  .v-item:hover .v-img,
  .v-item:focus-visible .v-img {
    filter: none;
  }

  .v-name {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
  }
  .v-item:hover .v-name {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .v-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-top: 0.15rem;
  }
  .v-label::before {
    content: "# ";
    color: var(--term-punct-color);
  }

  .v-copy {
    font-family: "Inter", sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-top: 0.4rem;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .v-img,
    .v-item {
      transition: none;
    }
  }
  @media (hover: none), (max-width: 720px) {
    .v-img {
      filter: none;
    }
  }

  /* Schmal: kompakte Zeilen – Vorschau links, Text rechts */
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .v-list {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 0;
    }
    .v-item {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 104px minmax(0, 1fr);
      grid-template-areas: "img name" "img label" "img copy";
      column-gap: 1rem;
      align-content: start;
      padding: 1rem 0;
    }
    .v-img {
      grid-area: img;
      align-self: start;
    }
    .v-name {
      grid-area: name;
      margin-top: 0;
    }
    .v-label {
      grid-area: label;
    }
    .v-copy {
      grid-area: copy;
      font-size: 0.84rem;
    }
  }
</style>
